<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0c1626"><title>BellaNova | SOS Sender</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/live-ui.css?v=1"></head>
<body data-role="sos"><div class="layout"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="identity"><div class="brandmark">✦</div><div><strong>BellaNova</strong><small>LIFECRISIS AI</small></div></div><div class="role-label"><span class="pulse"></span> SOS SENDER · SIMULATION</div><nav id="nav"><button class="nav active" data-go="overview">▦ <span>Live Overview (Dashboard)</span></button><button class="nav" data-go="requests">◉ <span>SOS Requests</span></button><button class="nav" data-go="fairshare">⚖ <span>FairShare</span></button><button class="nav" data-go="silentzone">◎ <span>SilentZone</span></button></nav><div class="sidebar-foot">PRIVATE NETWORK DEMO<br><span id="connect-state">Connecting…</span><p>No SOS reaches real responders.</p></div></aside><main class="content"><header class="top"><div><p class="eyebrow">BELLA NOVA / EMERGENCY ASSISTANCE</p><h1 id="page-title">Live Overview</h1><p class="muted">One shared server · Human-supervised fictional response</p></div><div class="profile">SOS PORTAL <span class="avatar">SOS</span></div></header><div id="flash" role="status" class="flash" hidden></div>
<section class="view show" data-view="overview"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Live emergency overview</h2><p class="muted">Identical shared totals on both laptops</p></div><span class="live-chip">● LIVE</span></div><div id="stats" class="stats"></div></section>
<section class="view" data-view="requests"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Send an SOS</h2><p class="muted">Submit fictional emergency information for coordinator review</p></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="panel"><form id="sos-form"><label for="person">Affected person's name *</label><input id="person" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Name"><label for="area">Area / Village *</label><input id="area" maxlength="120" required placeholder="Village or community"><label for="place">Location *</label><div class="location"><input id="place" maxlength="200" required placeholder="Enter location manually"><button type="button" class="secondary" id="gps-btn">Use My GPS Location</button></div><p class="hint" id="gps-hint">GPS may require HTTPS; manual location always works.</p><label for="help">Type of help *</label><select id="help" required><option value="">Select required help</option><option>Food / Water</option><option>Rescue Operation</option><option>Medicine</option><option>Shelter</option><option>Other</option></select><label for="description">Emergency description <span class="muted">(optional)</span></label><textarea id="description" maxlength="500" rows="3" placeholder="Optional details"></textarea><button class="primary full" id="submit-sos" type="submit">SEND SOS</button></form></div><div class="panel"><h3>Request history</h3><p class="muted">Updates when the coordinator confirms priority, help or resolution.</p><div id="sos-list" class="cards"></div></div></div></section>
<section class="view" data-view="fairshare"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>FairShare</h2><p class="muted">Live shared food/water allocations · view only</p></div></div><div id="fairshare-content"></div></section>
<section class="view" data-view="silentzone"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>SilentZone</h2><p class="muted">Field-check status for areas without communication</p></div></div><div id="silentzone-content"></div></section>
<footer>SIMULATION / RESEARCH PROTOTYPE · Not an operational emergency service</footer></main></div><script src="/live-ui.js?v=1" defer></script></body></html>
